four other members to be nominated by the Government having regard to their knowledge and experience relevant to
the functions and powers of the Board.

5.
Disqualification.
- No person shall be appointed as, or continue to be a member of the Board :
(a)
if he is of unsound mind and stands so declared by a competent court;
(b)
if he is an undischarged insolvent;
(c)
if he is not a citizen of India;
(d)
if he is interested, directly or indirectly in any business of development of land in the Nation Capital Region;
